# The character pass's bindings for `coax wgsl aethyr/render/character.coax` (coax/web/wgsl-module.coax):
# NAME GROUP BINDING, and `uniform COUNT` for a []f32 read as a uniform block of COUNT vec4fs.
# coax/web/host.js's character pass: group 0 the SceneLights block (aethyr/render/scene-lights.coax,
# SCL_FLOATS / 4 rows); group 1 the character's vertex words, its palette store, its texture layers
# and their sampler; group 2 the world's shadow map and its comparison sampler.
u 0 0 uniform 68
vertices 1 0
bones 1 1
sheets 1 2
sheet 1 3
shadow_map 2 0
shadow_cmp 2 1
